6817-554a-9ba5-e7cd52315143","export":true,"mirror_uv":false,"isOpen":false,"locked":false,"visibility":false,"autouv":0,"rotation":[0,0,0],"children":["65604be9-2b8d-502f-9fa9-07861398c694","2ac2041d-e1b1-55e2-bf9a-8b49e359f0e9","c2c1f2f3-b6f7-5c5e-9749-12d3a27dffd0","c0ab6a90-e4cb-5602-9f65-a6e5c0bde8e9","365e9dd6-b6ef-5a3f-aa93-66697a2a4fe6","3bc21a22-25b3-536c-bde0-ff43c29835fd"]}]}],"textures":[{"path":"crop_carrot.png","name":"crop_carrot.png","folder":"","namespace":"","id":"0","width":32,"height":64,"uv_width":32,"uv_height":64,"particle":false,"use_as_default":true,"layers_enabled":false,"sync_to_project":"","render_mode":"default","render_sides":"auto","frame_time":1,"frame_order_type":"loop","frame_order":"","frame_interpolate":false,"visible":true,"internal":true,"saved":true,"uuid":"8e60f141-2a02-5bf7-96dc-d968d94c5421","relative_path":"crop_carrot.png","source":"data:image/png;base64,"}],"animations":[],"description":"# crop_carrot\n\nCarrot row: feathery green tops (about 30 cm, 11 u, when ripe), orange crowns showing at the soil.\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -8..8, y 0..3, z -6..6 units (0.45 x 0.09 x 0.34 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 32 x 64, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 70.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 16 x 3 x 12 (w x h x d), centred at x 0, z 0\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `seeded` (visible by default): dark tilled ridge with seed holes\n- `sprout`: first green shoots\n- `growing`: half-grown green plants\n- `ripe`: full feathery tops, orange shoulders at the soil\n- `harvested`: after harvest\n\n## Notes\n\n- One row segment, 1 column (16 u) long along X, centred on the origin; tile rows side by side every 16 u in Z for a field.\n"}